OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,FSainsbury's has agreed to sell its
OL,7,FArgos business to a retail firm in a
OL,8,Fdeal worth at least #120 million,
OL,9,Fexpected to complete in February next
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe grocery chain said the deal will
OL,13,Fallow it to focus on its core food and
OL,14,Fgrocery operations, adding it was
OL,15,Fstill "business as usual" for Argos
OL,16,Fworkers and customers.
OL,18,FThe supermarket bought Argos for #1.4
OL,19,Fbillion in 2016, when it had roughly
OL,20,F845 standalone stores.
OL,26,@wD@GOUwD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
