OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,FSwift Partners, whose shareholders
OL,7,Finclude former Co-operative Group boss
OL,8,FRichard Pennycook, will buy 201 Argos
OL,9,Fstandalone stores, as well as its 466
OL,10,Fstores within Sainsbury's shops.
OL,12,FThe sale is based on a long-term
OL,13,Fagreement and a further 466 collection
OL,14,Fpoints, logistics network, pet
OL,15,Finsurance and product warranty cover.
OL,17,FSwift will also buy Sainsbury's
OL,18,Fdistribution centre in Daventry and
OL,19,FSainsbury's sourcing offices located
OL,20,Fin Shanghai and Hong Kong as part of
OL,21,Fthe deal.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,FSwift is a new firm set up by retail
OL,7,Fexperts including Mr Pennycook, former
OL,8,FMorrisons chief operating officer
OL,9,FTrevor Strain, and backed by Matt
OL,10,FTruman and his retail investment and
OL,11,Fadvisory firm, True Capital.
OL,13,FSainsbury's will get cash proceeds of
OL,14,Fat least #120 million from the sale,
OL,15,Fwith a #70 million up-front payment
OL,16,Fwhen the deal completes, with a full
OL,17,Fseparation of the Argos business by
OL,18,F2029.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
