FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,FSainsbury's did not disclose how many
OL,7,Fstaff members will transfer to Swift
OL,8,FPartners under the deal.
OL,10,FSimon Roberts, chief executive of
OL,11,FSainsbury's, said: "As we have
OL,12,Fstrengthened our core food business,
OL,13,Fwe have carefully considered what it
OL,14,Fwill take to create the strongest
OL,15,Fpossible future for Argos.
OL,26,@sD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,F"Swift brings retail leadership,
OL,7,Foperational expertise, technology
OL,8,Fcapability and long-term investment,
OL,9,Falongside a deep commitment and belief
OL,10,Fin the future potential for Argos
OL,11,Fcustomers and colleagues.
OL,13,F"Richard, Trevor and Matt understand
OL,14,Fand value the Argos brand, share our
OL,15,Fvalues and will accelerate Argos's
OL,16,Ftransformation through their dedicated
OL,17,Fexpertise and long-term investment."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
