OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FMr Pennycook will act as executive
OL,12,Fchairman of Argos following the
OL,13,Facquisition, dedicating three days a
OL,14,Fweek to the business, while Mr Strain
OL,15,Fand Mr Truman will serve on the Argos
OL,16,Fboard.
OL,18,FMr Pennycook said: "We believe
OL,19,Fstrongly in Argos's future and see
OL,20,Freal opportunities to invest and build
OL,21,Fon its progress.
OL,26,@zD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,F"We see clear potential to strengthen
OL,7,FArgos's customer proposition, digital
OL,8,Fcapabilities and nationwide reach."
OL,10,FThe sale comes after it emerged in
OL,11,FSeptember last year that Sainsbury's
OL,12,Fhad held talks to sell Argos to
OL,13,FChinese e-commerce giant JD.com (not
OL,14,Flinked to British retailer JD Sports),
OL,15,Fthough the discussions swiftly
OL,16,Fcollapsed.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,FBut many of the standalone stores have
OL,7,Fsince been shut, and sales at the
OL,8,Fchain have flagged in recent years,
OL,9,Fwith Sainsbury's leading a revamp of
OL,10,Fthe firm.
OL,12,FBally Auluk, national officer at
OL,13,Fretail trade union Usdaw, said: "We
OL,14,Frecognise this announcement will
OL,15,Fcreate uncertainty for those affected,
OL,16,Fand we will provide support, advice
OL,17,Fand representation throughout the
OL,18,Fprocess.
OL,26,@uD@aOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785496709
OL,3,CSainsbury's sells Argos to Swift
OL,4,CPartners in #120 million deal
OL,6,F"Swift has a good track record of
OL,7,Fengagement with Usdaw and we welcome
OL,8,Fthe commitment to keeping the model of
OL,9,Fstore-in-store, standalone stores and
OL,10,FLocal Fulfilment Centres and that any
OL,11,Fchanges will be handled fairly,
OL,12,Ftransparently and in consultation with
OL,13,Femployees and their union
OL,14,Frepresentatives.
OL,16,F"Our focus will be on protecting our
OL,17,Fmembers' jobs, terms and conditions
OL,18,Fand minimising disruption wherever
OL,19,Fpossible."
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU{D@JO]
